// LanBridge - Windows resource script.
//
// Resource id 1: Windows picks the lowest-numbered ICON resource as the
// executable's icon, which is what Explorer / taskbar / shortcuts display.
// The full multi-size app.ico (16/24/32/48/64/72/96/128/256) is used here;
// the trimmed favicon.ico served to browsers is embedded separately by
// tools/embed.ps1.
//
// This file is ASCII on purpose - rc.exe reads it as ANSI by default.

1 ICON "app.ico"
